. How to recognize it

Think Sliding Window when the question contains:
    subarray / substring
    contiguous elements
    longest / shortest / maximum / minimum
    fixed size k
    at most / at least k
    sum of a contiguous range
    longest substring satisfying a condition

2. Main types
There are mainly 2 patterns:
Sliding Window
│
├── Fixed Size Window                                 right moves → when size becomes k → calculate → remove left.
│   └── Window size = k
└── Variable Size Window
    └── Expand + Shrink based on condition             right expands → condition breaks → left shrinks → update answer.

3 Most optimized sliding-window problems:

Time  → O(n)
Space → O(1) or O(n)
